Privacy Policy — Convertly

Last Updated: September 30, 2026

Convertly is an offline unit conversion application. Your privacy is important to us. This Privacy Policy explains how Convertly handles information when you use the app.

1. No Personal Data Collection

Convertly does not collect, transmit, or share personal information with us or our servers.

We do not collect information such as:

Name
Email address
Phone number
Location
Contacts
Photos or media
Account information
Payment information
Personal identifiers

Convertly does not require users to create an account.

2. Offline Functionality

Convertly is designed to work offline.

The core conversion calculations are performed directly on your device and do not require an internet connection.

3. Local App Data

Convertly may store certain app-related information locally on your device to provide its features, including:

Favorite conversions
Recent conversion history
Selected units
Precision preferences
Theme preferences
Other app settings

This information remains on your device and is not uploaded to our servers.

4. Conversion Data

Values entered into Convertly for conversion are processed locally on your device.

For example, values such as:

10 kilometers
5 kilograms
25°C
2 liters

are processed locally to calculate the requested conversion.

We do not receive or store these conversion values on a remote server.

5. Data Sharing

Convertly does not sell, rent, or share your personal information with third parties.

The app does not use a remote database or developer-operated server to collect your information.

6. Third-Party Services

Convertly does not intentionally use third-party services for advertising, analytics, tracking, authentication, or cloud storage.

If third-party SDKs or services are added in a future version, this Privacy Policy will be updated to reflect the applicable data practices.

7. Permissions

Convertly is designed to operate without unnecessary sensitive device permissions.

The app does not require access to:

Location
Camera
Microphone
Contacts
Photos
Phone
SMS
Calendar

for its core conversion functionality.

8. Data Security

Because your conversion data, favorites, history, and preferences are stored locally on your device and are not transmitted to our servers, we do not have access to this locally stored information.

You are responsible for maintaining the security of your device.

9. Data Retention and Deletion

Convertly does not maintain a server-side account or database containing your personal information.

Locally stored app data can generally be removed by:

Clearing the app's data through your device settings, or
Uninstalling Convertly.
10. Children's Privacy

Convertly does not knowingly collect personal information from children or other users.

Since the app does not require an account or collect personal information for its core functionality, users can use the converter without providing personal information.

11. Changes to This Privacy Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy if the app's features or data practices change.

Any updates will be published on this page with a new Last Updated date.

